			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5750fe9a-5c09-4b75-af23-872d17f22789")
	)
	(text "Function: J4 is a horizontal USB2 device socket; cable entry is parallel to the PCB.\nR6/R7 are CC pulldowns; C16/FB2 connect shield to GND at high frequency.\nSource / changes: GCT USB4110-GF-A, USB4110 revB4,22May2024,sheet1/2:\nhttps://gct.co/files/drawings/usb4110.pdf\nCodex adapts BRK8305 A03,25Oct2023,JTAG sheet8/PDFp4:\nJ500/R500/R501/FB503/C522 -> J4/R6/R7/FB2/C16.\nhttps://pins.opalkelly.com/downloads/583/download?category_id=3\nPCB alternative replaces USB4105 with USB4110 and four SMT shell stakes.\nBaseline saved schematic still named vertical USB4120; this proposal fixes J4\nmetadata.\nAll20 pin identities, UUIDs and wiring retained;16 A/B contacts unchanged.\nKiCad10 USB4110 footprint copied;4 SH pads renamed M1-M4.\nX/Y front face unchanged; mating height1.68mm vs USB4105 1.73mm (0.05mm Z).\n3D is an inherited datasheet-derived shell envelope, not manufacturer CAD.\nR6/R7=5.1k,FB2=220ohm at100MHz,C16=100nF; BRK DNP straps omitted.\nD+/D- duplicated contacts joined; SBU unused. USB_D_P/N to U3.7/.6.\nUSB5V is separate from carrier12V/buck3.3V. No USB data/VBUS ESD array.\nEnclosure/cable fit, ESD/EMI and assembly remain unverified.\nV2 Codex DFM adaptation: A1/A12/B1/B12 corner radius 0.15 -> 0.30 mm;\n0.60 x 1.15 mm land bounds, pin/NPTH centers and drills unchanged.\nTwo local zone-only keepouts provide >=0.272 mm boss-hole clearance.\nC16 remains100nF0402; KEMET C0402C104K8PACTU -> Samsung\nCL05B104KO5NNNC,16V X7R; Samsung Reference Sheet,9Apr2024,p1A/B:\nhttps://product.samsungsem.com/part/download.do?masterKey=CL05B104KO5NNN&type=specsheet\nV7 (Claude, 24 Nov 2026): FB2 LCSC C85840 (BLM21PG221SN1D, out of stock) ->\nC88994 BLM21PG221SH1D, same Murata 220 ohm 2 A 0805 series and land (confirm sheet)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 66.04 538.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "635543e1-b989-4b54-beb0-425cc6041f2d")
	)
	(text "Function: U6 translates TDO from XEM1.8V to FTDI3.3V.\nSource / changes: Opal Kelly BRK8305 A03,25Oct2023,\nJTAG sheet8/PDFp4: U503/C519/C520 -> U6/C38/C39.\nhttps://pins.opalkelly.com/downloads/583/download?category_id=3\nSame SN74AXC1T45DBVR and two100nF values; topology unchanged.\nCodex redraw follows BRK row spacing and vertical bypass layout.\nRail names: USBJTAG_3.3V / XEM_1.8V; DGND renamed GND.\nTI SCES882E,Dec2023,pp3,18:\nhttps://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/sn74axc1t45.pdf\nDIR5=GND (B-to-A). PCB/powered operation remain unverified.\nV2 bypass part selection: same two100nF0402 positions; KEMET ->\nSamsung CL05B104KO5NNNC,16V X7R. No R or wire changes.\nSamsung Reference Sheet,9Apr2024,p1A/B:\nhttps://product.samsungsem.com/part/download.do?masterKey=CL05B104KO5NNN&type=specsheet"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 464.185 497.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "696ced93-e56f-4a22-a7c0-0fc7d657f8de")
	)
	(text "Level shifters (BRK8305 style)"
