	(text "Function: U3 converts USB2 to JTAG through its MPSSE engine. Y1 is its12MHz\nreference; U8 stores optional USB identity/configuration. Local capacitors\nbypass each supply; FB1/FB3/FB4 separate the shown rail branches.\nSource / changes: inherited Opal Kelly BRK8305 A03,25Oct2023,JTAG sheet8/\nPDFp4; locally renumbered/redrawn, topology and nominal values retained.\nhttps://pins.opalkelly.com/downloads/583/download?category_id=3\nFTDI DS_FT232H,external EEPROM configuration section7:\nhttps://ftdichip.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/DS_FT232H.pdf\nMicrochip DS20001794J (2023),p39 ordering: T=tape/reel only.\nhttps://www.microchip.com/en-us/product/93lc56b\nCodex V2 selects Samsung CL05B104KO5NNNC,100nF16V X7R0402 for\nC14/C19/C22-C25/C28/C30-C32 (previously KEMET C0402C104K8PACTU).\nC16 and translator bypass adaptations are recorded beside those blocks.\nSamsung Reference Sheet,9Apr2024,p1A/B (dimensions/ratings):\nhttps://product.samsungsem.com/part/download.do?masterKey=CL05B104KO5NNN&type=specsheet\nU3 order suffix -REEL is packaging only. No R/C values or wire changes.\nU8 V4: 93LC56BT-E/MS replaces93LC56B-E/MS; T is packaging only.\nB=128x16,E=-40..125C,/MS=8-MSOP retained; no land/pin/wire change.\nStandard blank EEPROM,not BRK CFG001; program and verify after bring-up.\nHost/Vivado compatibility is not yet tested.\nFB1/FB3/FB4 V4: MI0603J601R-10 -> Murata BLM18KG601SN1D.\n600ohm100MHz +/-25% retained; DCR0.20 ->0.15ohm maximum.\nRated current1A ->1.3A at85C/1A at125C ambient; derating applies.\nMurata JENF243A_0003AN-01,pp2(ratings),5(body),10(lands):\nhttps://pim.murata.com/asset/pim4/ferriteBeadInductortypefilter/ENFA0003_PDF_FERRITEBEADINDUCTORTYPEFILTER\nSame rail wiring/R/C; inherited lands differ from recommended lands.\nBias filtering/EMI,assembly and powered behavior remain unverified.\nU8 V7 (Claude, 24 Nov 2026): 93LC56BT-E/MS C2061196 (out of stock) -> 93AA56B-I/MS C1350563:\nsame DS20001794 family, B=128x16, MSOP-8 pinout and land; 1.8-5.5 V, -40..85 C (was -40..125 C)."
		(at 308.48 560 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "748611d4-cef6-5a22-8f5b-2a3e0fcfa415")
	)
