	(text "Function: Short MC2.14 (VREFP) to MC2.16 (GNDADC)\nto select the XEM8305 internal SYSMON ADC reference.\n\nSource / changes: Opal Kelly XEM8305, Expansion\nConnectors, SYSMON; web page accessed 31 Oct 2026:\nhttps://docs.opalkelly.com/xem8305/expansion-connectors/\nCodex V6 adds direct copper instead of a removable\n0-ohm link. Module C168 remains its default 0.1uF.\nGNDADC retains the module FB2 return; no carrier GND\nor MC2.18 (VCCADC) tie is added. External-reference\nuse would require removing this short."
		(at 228.6 180.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f12789b4-8dee-5666-8d62-fb417ab8fcfe")
	)
